	(text "Front panel\nFit J602 for the SPI ST7789 (as on the Audio Kit build) or J603 for an I2C OLED\n(then fit R105/R106 on the main board). Check the module's pin order before soldering:\nOLED modules come as GND-VCC-SCL-SDA and VCC-GND-SCL-SDA.\nST7789 reset: R601/C602 RC at power-up (the firmware has no reset pin). Backlight always on.\nButtons pull to GND; BTN1 (GPIO36) has its 10k pull-up on the main board.\nD601/R602 optional (status LED on the panel instead of J_LED)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.6 22.86 0)
